  "description": "PAJHIT crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H168 O18 Sm4,4(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm2B (Sm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.586-3.988 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.33-112.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C108H168O18Sm4·4(C4H8O).",
